      "body": "## Motivation\n\nThe single-GPU diffusion shards in #45761 finished in approximately 16–21 minutes, below the intended roughly 30-minute shard budget. Their scheduling estimates no longer reflect the recorded testcase durations.\n\n## Modifications\n\nUpdate 50 H100 single-GPU `estimated_full_test_time_s` values using the existing successful [CI run 39736544560](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39736544560). Use the largest observed individual attempt per testcase, rounded up to 10 seconds. These estimates cause the current planner to select three shards instead of five, with an estimated 30-minute budget per shard.\n\nKeep the testcase inventory, standalone-file estimates, two-GPU/B200 scheduling, and all performance, memory, and consistency thresholds unchanged. Leave the newly added Wan Animate distilled testcase's estimate unchanged because it was absent from the sampled run.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nScheduling metadata only; generation settings and accuracy thresholds are unchanged.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nThe source CI run contains 50 unique measured testcases with 72.2 minutes of summed maximum per-case wall time. The new three-shard layout has not been executed; the 30-minute figures are scheduling estimates, not measured new job durations. No additional GPU runs were requested for this calibration.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #39866505500](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39866505500)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39866505459](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39866505459)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39866505431](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39866505431)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
